{"game": "mass-effect-3", "language": "english", "appid": 1238020, "month": "2024-11", "window": 1, "start_date": 1730419200, "end_date": 1733011199, "month_true_total": 8, "quota": 8, "returned": 8, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 19:54:50 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "180648184", "author": {"steamid": "76561198032117350", "personaname": "ClickinOrka", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198032117350/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 420, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 420, "last_played": 1644313594, "avatar": "40e0d51f27781dedc4be1831ccd751bd67cbdcfa"}, "language": "english", "review": "Always a ME fan since the beginning. Great story and gameplay.", "timestamp_created": 1732845163, "timestamp_updated": 1732845163, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.506740152835845947", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "179770313", "author": {"steamid": "76561198826806909", "personaname": "Low_Key_Magic", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198826806909/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 1690, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 432, "last_played": 1733096672, "avatar": "28c5d9783ed598a5e309ed2ed49bc88f5f91bbc8"}, "language": "english", "review": "12 years later and the multiplayer still has people playing. While the legendary edition is worth it for the upgraded graphics and gameplay, I still recommend the classic for the multiplayer. It's a simple game loop focusing on the combat but allows you to play as a variety of the races from the trilogy. Salarian STG? Yep. Krogan with a huge hammer? Yep. A freed collector with insane biotic powers? It's here. The enemies are various enough to keep the gameplay engaging. If you've never played it or like me haven't played in years, it's worth it. keep the multiplayer alive!", "timestamp_created": 1732509359, "timestamp_updated": 1732509359, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 40, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.769883215427398682", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 18, "count": 2}, {"reaction_type": 5, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 6, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "179568689", "author": {"steamid": "76561198127710459", "personaname": "Alley Cat Alyson", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198127710459/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 132, "playtime_forever": 1852, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1851, "last_played": 1741866333, "avatar": "9f3e6f6382b34b3abdba7c093c5e9f9e198a8d61"}, "language": "english", "review": "man, the multiplayer is so fun in this, the loot boxes in it were.... well certainly not as bad as many other games. but even if you arent interested in that and just want the campaign, then its still quite solid despite some bugs and dealing with EA to get started. i have no idea how the 4th game came from this one, but for the price atm? id recommend waiting for a sale so its a bit more reasonable.", "timestamp_created": 1732281975, "timestamp_updated": 1732281975, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 7, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.551734864711761475", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "178983432", "author": {"steamid": "76561197978606173", "personaname": "bootysalads", "pers